cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tiny_agent in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: tiny_agent
authors:
  - family-names: Haj Amor
    given-names: Riadh
repository-code: "https://github.com/rhajamor/tiny_agent"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  tiny_agent is a header-only C++20 AI agent framework for building
  tool-using agents in C++: multi-provider from the start, MCP built in
  over stdio and HTTP, MIT licensed, and small enough to run at the edge,
  on a Raspberry Pi or against a local llama.cpp server.
